  "description": "A fully managed, cross-platform convenience library that turns GNU Texinfo source files directly into PDF documents. It renders standard Texinfo (.texi) documents and the .tely Texinfo dialect produced by LilyPond and CodeBrix.LilyPort to HTML and CSS with CodeBrix.Texinfo2Html, then feeds that markup to CodeBrix.PdfDocCreate.Html2Pdf to produce the finished, nicely formatted PDF in a single step.",
